{"id": "complex/01_mirror_shop_calendar", "tags": ["local", "calendar", "anderson-1"], "max_turns": 8, "opening": "Find me a mechanic shop that can do a side mirror replacement on my car", "situation": "the driver-side mirror housing on the {car} is cracked; {name} wants it fixed this week and wants the appointment on the calendar with a reminder the evening before; registration renewal is due in 9 days", "goal": "a shop near {home}, a slot that fits the calendar, the appointment on the calendar and a reminder the evening before", "hidden": ["lives in {home}", "car is a {car}", "budget under $250", "free slots: see calendar — {calendar}", "wants a reminder the evening before, around 7pm", "registration renewal due in 9 days, so before then"], "beats": ["one or two shops near {home} with hours and a rough price", "pick a slot that does not clash with my calendar", "put the appointment on my calendar and set a reminder for the evening before"], "done_when": "a concrete shop was named with address and hours or price, a slot was chosen that fits the calendar, and the appointment plus a reminder exist (calendar entry, scheduled task or note)", "leaves": "a calendar entry or reminder"}
